      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thought of one more.. I know it was talked about a long time ago on the canny but not sure how far it got..\nWhat about the ability to create groups and have your group tag or image displayed on your nameplate? This would solely be the ability to CREATE and MANAGE a group whereas all users would be able to join them! \nThanks ^^ Hope the community and devs can find a way for everyone to be satisfied. I think its great to have a subscription to keep the game going but just hope there are more worthwhile features that come with the pricetag.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
