      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think they have any weight to market anything too many problems with consistency, unless they want to retract the game being free to play, unlimited model uploads, there's really nothing. If they tack on actual game features into a paid monthly package that makes things more convenient that's a giant middle finger to this community. \nPeople use mods because the game lacks any meaningful quality of life.",
