      "value": "@{5fb8205b31fddc2396742d8b|full_name}: The events tab doesn't seem like a bad idea but the whitelisting/blacklisting is a bad idea. There isn't a point in whitelisting or blacklisting players from worlds when you have a block button and/or have things such as invite/invite+/friends/friends+ instances. The audio control for individual players has been requested since 2017 and has yet to be implemented. If I have to pay to be able to adjust the volume of other players I will scream my head off. You're insane if you think VRChat should put such a feature behind a paywall.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
