      "value": "@{5fb8205b31fddc2396742d8b|full_name}: If I may be honest, I do think that VRC+ should be only for people that want to support the game. No added features, no benefits, only a supporter badge. I don't really care about how much money it would cost to be a supporter but if they are going to sell us features on an expensive subscription then I will at least try to speak up about how it isn't worth it. There are no features that come to mind that would make me pay $10/month ($100/year).",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
