      "value": "- Global dynamic bones\n- Real avatar-to-avatar physics interaction\n- Custom locomotion in worlds that don't disallow that, using your own locally run Udon script for that, e.g. flying etc.\n- Debug window with player position and who is currently world master\n- Voice volume per avatar\n- World portal blocker\n- Perma-ban players from your own world\n- Real avatar perf block based on avatar frametime\nOR\n- access to official mod store where people can submit non-offensive mods that than get whitelisted by vrchat\ntl;dr, basicly the stuff people have been using mods for since years",
